PROJECT: AAVE

## Ecosystem Position

Primary Sector: Decentralized Lending / Liquidity Protocol

Secondary Sector: Stablecoin Infrastructure (GHO), Institutional DeFi (Aave Arc, Aave Horizon), Cross-Chain Infrastructure (Aave V4 Hub-and-Spoke)

Primary Chain: Ethereum

Supported Chains: Ethereum, Polygon, Avalanche, BNB Chain, Fantom, Harmony, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Gnosis, Scroll, Metis, ZKsync Era, Linea, Mantle, Plasma

Sources: https://aave.com (Phase 1), https://www.htx.com.gl/tokens/aave/ (Phase 1 L17-L19), https://aave.com (Phase 1 L10-L11)

