## Major Integrations

Integration Name: Chainlink CCIP Integration
Integrated With: Chainlink (Entity 34)
Purpose: Standar cross-chain interoperability untuk Aave V4 hub-and-spoke architecture
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Aave V4 launch dengan arsitektur hub-and-spoke menggunakan CCIP)
Sources: https://www.kucoin.com (Phase 4 L5-L9), https://aave.com/docs/aave-v4 (Phase 4)

Integration Name: Polygon AMM Markets & Liquidity Mining
Integrated With: Polygon (Entity 46)
Purpose: AMM markets di Aave V2 dan program liquidity mining $40M+ MATIC
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-013 (Kemitraan Aave dengan Polygon), EV-014 (Program Liquidity Mining Aave-Polygon $40 Juta)
Sources: https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2021/03/31/defi-major-aave-working-with-polygon-to-bypass-ethereum-congestion/ (Phase 3 EV-013), https://polygon.technology/blog/defiforall-kicking-off-l2-defi-summer-with-40-million-usd-in-liquidity-mining-rewards-from-polygon-for-aaves-polygon-markets (Phase 3 EV-014)

